  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Ported RemoveNamedView, ModifyNamedView and independently acquired ADINA export, analysis error and warning message operations with complete matching XML IntelliSense. Added exact-build and native-signature capability checks, immutable named status/message results and bounded message retrieval. Preserved current-binding, constructing-thread, lifetime and reentrancy guards through acquisition and execution. The package exposes 52 common Root contracts and three optional Root operations; see the view/optional guide for usage and native qualification limits.",
